         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Which is Better in Fat Times and in Lean Times: the Macho Man vs. the Nice Guy? Priming Effects on Polish and Norwegian Studentsâ€™ Mate Preferences</rdf:li>
